# S22b, member b (k10, slot 1, replaying at most 300 steps a second): west with the others; stays when a and c
# leave; follows at @322 s: a JOIN of their stag0102 instance whose catch-up runs when c forks off; b follows the
# instance id (a's side) and joins a.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@91
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
route {route:stag0101_west:-280,-190}
wander -280 -190 6 until present=1 fail stagechange
log a and c left
wander -280 -190 6 until epoch>=@322 fail stagechange
log b follows
mat matz02 yes until stage=stag0102,control
log in stag0102
wander 345 115 10 until frames>=900 or present=1,frames>=60 fail stagechange
log enough
idle until frames>=60
